-- Starter-village (Neutral) Clan Recruiter fix  (script 75129)
-- ------------------------------------------------------------
-- BUG: 75129 silently exited on Join -- no message, no enrollment. It did:
--        nClanType = GetClanType(nObjClanID)
--        if not nClanType then return end      <- bails before fAddToGuild
--      GetClanType returns nil for the clan, so the script returned before
--      ever enrolling. (NOT the 'max number of masters' error.)
--
-- FIX: 75129's join block is replaced with the SAME proven logic the HQ
--      recruiter (75024) uses -- no bail; add as RANK_MEMBER, gated on
--      rating>=100 and not-aggroed. The Type==0 branch is identical to 75024
--      and stays dormant under the NPC-leader/autoheal setup (no leader-making
--      in practice).
--
-- Built with luac_fwo (FWO Lua 5.0, MAXSTACK=300); verified by re-decompiling.
-- ============================================================
